Sample e-invoices in packages/verify/test/fixtures/einvoice/ (peppol-bis3-invoice.xml, zatca-standard-invoice.xml,
ksef-fa3-invoice.xml) were constructed for this repository's tests. They are not copied from any third party, and every
party, number and identifier in them is fictitious. Their element names and order follow the published specifications
named in each file's header: the Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 UBL Invoice syntax
(https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/billing/3.0/syntax/ubl-invoice/tree/), the ZATCA E-Invoice Data Dictionary v1.2 (2023-05-19)
with the XML Implementation Standard v1.2, and the KSeF FA(3) schema (http://crd.gov.pl/wzor/2025/06/25/13775/schemat.xsd).
